WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.897
In Milly Pond there lived a shy turtle called Tilly.

2
00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:15.053
Tilly the turtle had no friends, because she was shy.

3
00:00:15.054 --> 00:00:24.310
If anyone came by to talk or play, she would duck in her shell and wait until they went away.

4
00:00:24.311 --> 00:00:29.610
Then one day Freddy the frog came swimming by.

5
00:00:29.611 --> 00:00:32.689
"Tilly, don't hide in your shell.

6
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:35.189
I just want to play."

7
00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:38.178
But Tilly was too shy.

8
00:00:38.179 --> 00:00:43.315
"No. No. Just go away."

9
00:00:43.316 --> 00:00:46.096
Freddy the frog had many friends.

10
00:00:46.097 --> 00:00:48.087
He knew all the fish,

11
00:00:48.088 --> 00:00:50.276
he liked the dragonflies,

12
00:00:50.277 --> 00:00:52.565
he joked with the ladybugs,

13
00:00:52.566 --> 00:00:55.037
and he hung out with the bees,

14
00:00:55.038 --> 00:00:59.421
but his best friend was Betty the butterfly.

15
00:00:59.422 --> 00:01:02.160
"Hi, Betty. How are you?"

16
00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:04.655
"Hi, Freddy, I'm fine.

17
00:01:04.656 --> 00:01:06.648
How are you?"

18
00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:10.375
"I don't think Tilly the turtle likes me.

19
00:01:10.376 --> 00:01:21.154
Whenever I ask her to come out and play, she hides in her shell and won't come out until I go away."

20
00:01:21.155 --> 00:01:27.182
"Oh, Freddy. I think Tilly likes you, but she is very shy."

21
00:01:27.183 --> 00:01:29.505
"I don't understand.

22
00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:32.513
Why is Tilly the turtle shy?"

23
00:01:32.514 --> 00:01:36.831
"I don't know, but I have a story."

24
00:01:36.832 --> 00:01:39.755
"Oh, I like stories."

25
00:01:39.756 --> 00:01:46.027
"Well, many caterpillars are shy because caterpillars think they are ugly.

26
00:01:46.028 --> 00:01:53.097
I have known many caterpillars who wrap themselves up all winter, and hide away."

27
00:01:53.098 --> 00:01:56.886
"When it's cold, I hide away too."

28
00:01:56.887 --> 00:02:04.337
"Yes, but caterpillars are very lonely all winter, and their loneliness changes them."

29
00:02:04.338 --> 00:02:09.984
"Oh, I see. When I hide away, I'm with my family.

30
00:02:09.985 --> 00:02:13.768
It's hard to be lonely in my family."

31
00:02:13.769 --> 00:02:21.999
"In the spring, the caterpillars come out, but they are no longer ugly caterpillars who are shy;

32
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.986
they are instead, beautiful butterflies."

33
00:02:25.987 --> 00:02:31.517
"So, should I wait for Tilly to turn into a butterfly?"

34
00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:43.836
"No, you should keep asking her to come out and play because one day she'll come out of her shell, just like a butterfly comes out of a cocoon."

35
00:02:43.837 --> 00:02:52.030
Freddy liked Betty best because Betty was smart, and Freddy kept asking Tilly to come out and play.

36
00:02:52.031 --> 00:02:57.143
One day when he was just swimming by, he said to Tilly,

37
00:02:57.144 --> 00:03:01.047
"You can't have any friends if you hide in your shell.

38
00:03:01.048 --> 00:03:05.180
I think you should come on out and give it a try."

39
00:03:05.181 --> 00:03:09.603
Tilly was lonely and she knew that Freddy was right.

40
00:03:09.604 --> 00:03:14.532
She had no friends because she always hid in her shell.

41
00:03:14.533 --> 00:03:28.027
So, Tilly poked her head out and looked all around, and she was amazed at how many new friends she found.

42
00:03:28.028 --> 00:03:33.801
If you are shy and lonely, then learn a lesson from Tilly the turtle.

43
00:03:33.802 --> 00:03:38.222
To find a friend, you need to come out of your shell.
